{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 39","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/257c4be14cb6884080ab513097bf4a75604b0798.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b}{a}=\\frac{b}{a+b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"110\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/206b7ac0e5d27c51195834094f3dc5125524e259.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{both rational}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{both real but not rational}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{both not real}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"548\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/8/dd896c1faabf46082a9cc50d38837e236d0d42ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{one real, one not real}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{one real, one not real or both not real}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"531\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/a/67a8181c9d9b8253bd721b620aaabc5b01f4af96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/9/4a94fe6192226e0fc83c328fd60cc763b216fc95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\neq -b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"17\" />.  Cross multiply both sides to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce049f4a6fe4c632a33226e51f59b9a54048ed9d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 + 2ab + b^2 = ab\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" />\nSubtract both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/e/9fef7cf665bb72b161fa423c6703eaf94bddf371.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 + ab + b^2 = 0\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />\nFrom the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_formula\" title=\"Quadratic formula\">quadratic formula</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/0/510ea26a7484c93622f2e908c8de305aeea5a860.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4b^2}}{2}\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"40\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/4/ca43c798dc91274a339a6be3a35254d3ce937564.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{-3b^2}}{2}\\]\" width=\"133\" height=\"40\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Real\">real</a>, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/5/6952464493114bc78ccfd699ae962d35f481bcc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{-3b^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> is imaginary because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a51005e4ed9fcd0d2e4d6a071baf321f1c57871.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3b^2$\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" /> is negative.\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is not real, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1cea78e3c02c431048bf9ed7414b96e4a6f40708.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = m+ni$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/3/df3f9bd7ea38f7336f5a64109d4053d775858f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/5/6952464493114bc78ccfd699ae962d35f481bcc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{-3b^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/81255347a5642af05b1448505d66ebc26b86bebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{-3m^2 - 6mni + 3n^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"176\" height=\"18\" />.  As long as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/8/678f96ced827c12d36ffa0a17e8d8e7ee62c4341.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"17\" />, the expression can also be imaginary because a real number squared will be a real number.\nFrom these two points, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZdM2ou5Gsuw?t=312\">https://youtu.be/ZdM2ou5Gsuw?t=312</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" titl